hor_innocentmaid_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_11","text":"I'm coming in, Master.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_12","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_12","text":"Anchor doesn't reply for quite a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_13","text":"How should I describe","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_14","text":"the sound of opening a door","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_15","text":"more carefully?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_16","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_16","text":"*Creak*?","jump":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_18"},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_17","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_17","text":"*Slide*?","jump":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_18"},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_18","text":"No matter what I do,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_19","text":"the door's gonna make a sound.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_20","text":"And then you'll chew me out,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_21","text":"and I won't even get to eat the usual table scraps that I manage to save in time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_22","text":"I'd end up going hungry until tomorrow morning.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_23","text":"Come on, that's not true.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_24","text":"It's not?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_25","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_26","text":"So even if I make noise while opening the door, you won't scold me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_27","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_28","text":"And you won't yell at me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_29","text":"if I mess up a whole bunch","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_30","text":"while doing chores around the house?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_31","text":"Of course not.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_32","text":"Sweet!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_33","text":"You're the best, Master.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_34","text":"So you wouldn't reprimand me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_35","text":"even if you found out","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_36","text":"that I put a sea squirt","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_37","text":"in your pants pocket earlier?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_38","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_38","text":"I quickly check my pants pockets, which are fortunately bereft of a sea squirt.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_39","text":"Got ya!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_40","text":"You nearly gave me a heart attack.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_41","text":"You won't get mad, will you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_42","text":"There's no reason I would ever get mad at you, Anchor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_43","text":"Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_44","text":"Oh, by the way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_45","text":"Now that I've officially introduced myself,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_46","text":"I just wanna say that I'll be at your service from here on out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anchor_innocentmaid_01_47","text":"I hope you have a good day.","jump":null}],"chat":true}